<main id="top">
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap">
<div>
<h1>You know what to do. Let’s train the brain that has to do it.</h1>
<p class="lead">I’m Mayur Tambe, a founder brain performance coach. Cognidolph helps founders close the gap between knowing and doing in 90 days, with neuroscience-informed coaching on focus, decisions, habits and execution.</p>
<div class="row"><a class="btn" href="#contact">Book a free demo session</a><a class="btn ghost" href="#resources">Take the free 5-minute audit</a></div>
</div>
<div class="focus">
<button class="dotbtn" id="dotbtn" aria-label="Start a 30-second focus exercise"><span class="dot"></span></button>
<div class="count" id="count" aria-live="polite">30</div>
<small id="hint">Try it now. Press the circle, rest your gaze on the dot, and breathe for 30 seconds.</small>
</div>
</div></section>

<div class="stripe" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<section id="services"><div class="wrap">
<div class="intro"><h2>Where we work with you</h2><p class="muted">Most founders don’t need another productivity system. They need to see what their own patterns are doing to their days, and change them on purpose.</p></div>
<div class="grid">
<div><h3>One-to-one founder coaching</h3><p class="muted">Private sessions on the pattern that’s costing you most, whether that’s scattered focus, slow decisions, drained energy or habits that don’t stick. Start with a free demo session on one real challenge.</p></div>
<div><h3>Founder Brain Gym</h3><p class="muted">Free live online sessions and a WhatsApp community with brain exercises for focus, fearless decisions and resilience.</p></div>
<div><h3>Workshops for teams and campuses</h3><p class="muted">Behaviour change workshops for companies, and practical AI-for-business sessions for colleges and incubators.</p></div>
<div><img class="mascot" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Cognidolph dolphin mascot" width="84" height="86"><h3>Mendoot™ AI coach</h3><p class="muted">Our AI coaching tool for daily focus and habit practice between sessions. It’s in pilot with 500+ founders and individuals.</p></div>
</div></div></section>

<section id="method" class="band"><div class="wrap">
<h2>How a coaching engagement works</h2>
<p class="muted">Four steps, in order. We don’t move on until the one before has held for you.</p>
<ol class="steps">
<li><b>Understand</b><span>Map how you think, decide and react, using a short assessment and a first conversation.</span></li>
<li><b>Change the pattern</b><span>Pick one bottleneck and try specific, small experiments against it.</span></li>
<li><b>Build the behaviour</b><span>Turn what works into routines tied to your day, with weekly check-ins.</span></li>
<li><b>Improve performance</b><span>Review results, adjust, and add the next pattern.</span></li>
</ol>
</div></section>

<section id="resources"><div class="wrap two">
<div>
<h2>Is your brain the bottleneck in your business?</h2>
<p>Take the free Founder Brain Performance Audit: a 5-minute self-audit to assess your current brain performance, identify your key performance gaps, and get a personalised action plan.</p>
<p class="fine">The audit is a self-assessment for coaching purposes. It is not a medical or psychological diagnosis.</p>
</div>
<div>
<form id="lead" novalidate>
<label>Full name<input name="name" required autocomplete="name"></label>
<label>Email address<input name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email"></label>
<label>Contact number (optional)<input name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel"></label>
<button class="btn" type="submit">Start the free audit</button>
<p class="fine">By submitting, you agree to receive emails from Cognidolph. We never share your details.</p>
<div class="ok" id="ok" role="status">Thanks. We’ll email your audit link shortly.</div>
</form>
</div></div></section>

<section id="about" class="band"><div class="wrap two">
<div>
<div class="avatar" aria-hidden="true">MT</div>
<h2>Mayur Tambe</h2>
<p class="muted">Founder, Cognidolph</p>
</div>
<div>
<p>I’ve built and closed startups, worked in agri-business operations, and spent three years of my own life stuck in depression and self-doubt. That last part is why I coach the way I do: I care about the person making the decisions, not just the business.</p>
<p>I’m an internationally certified neurocoach with a diploma in neuropsychology, currently completing a Master’s in Clinical Psychology. I mentor early-stage founders with the Wadhwani Foundation and the Global Mentorship Initiative. In 2026 I completed the Stanford Seed Spark program, and Cognidolph is supported by the NETRARIT Foundation incubator.</p>
<p>Cognidolph is a small team: Snehal Rajguru (Director) and Jiya Khivsara (System Design), working with me. We also run Coaching Katta, our coaching centre in Nashik.</p>
</div></div></section>

<section><div class="wrap">
<h2>What clients say</h2>
